# Direct runtime dependencies — the only file to edit by hand.
#
# requirements.txt is the locked, hashed tree generated from this file:
#
#   pip install -r requirements-dev.txt     # pins pip-tools itself
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras requirements.in
#
# CI's lock check re-runs exactly this command, so add no other flags.
# Add --upgrade to bring the transitive pins current.
#
# Run it under the oldest supported Python (3.11) so markers resolve for
# every interpreter CI and production use. See AGENTS.md › Dependencies.
